# StepOne Career - Environment Variables Configuration

# 1. Supabase Backend (Get these from your project settings at https://supabase.com/dashboard)
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOi...

# 2. Stripe Payments (web checkout; get from https://dashboard.stripe.com/apikeys)
